{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000027502","bookName":"Rechazada por cuatro, elegida por Hades (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000027502/42000027502.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2633487,"followCount":65376,"introduction":"La Bruja Suprema Violeta sacrifica una magia inmensa para salvar a cuatro señores sobrenaturales, quienes caen en los oscuros engaños de la cambiaformas Pandora. Ellos matan a Mona, su lince espiritual, y le arrebatan toda su brujería. Protegida en secreto por Hades, el Señor del Inframundo, mediante la antigua magia del alma, Violeta lo elige como su esposo. Cuando la malicia de Pandora queda expuesta, los cuatro se hunden en el remordimiento.","chapterCount":42,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Rechazada-por-cuatro-elegida-por-Hades-Doblado","bookNameLower":"rechazada-por-cuatro-elegida-por-hades-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-09-12 10:00:02","firstShelfTime":"2026-09-12 10:00:02","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701615725","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/52/2x0/20x5/205x7/20572000024/701615725_2/701615725.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=WVOjD4bd4KfVUKNVGhEQBPhIAklTrCn3mcEukvP-inNVm0VR5IyhNpioh~H8jXoqXfZ0q9LI79sMaRVfoCbbqAO1RIID5Ic27WRaq1goQc1tFgu7FuPnvkJjBE~YTdH84iM13iipxYnFZtMWQo~5FbmE3djEyNuEJ0rgTaYp~FhxRctey-iATggZZPChxw9m~Ys~ZwXYEZpG8gtrpR9tVHMzmu2KIYQDQFsj3cJ32RCGZbVn13NufFRedZRRcr1wiSyC4-VtjZutqHQW7EksSynuKuUu4525wwvP2f9uokvwTML3vlpsawoxNLcFINB-EAGRx1qo1KfQo6xNozSPeQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/52/2x0/20x5/205x7/20572000024/701615725_2/701615725.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":198387,"price":0},{"id":"701615726","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"http